LIGGGHTS (Version LIGGGHTS-PUBLIC 3.8.0, compiled 2026-11-18 09:21:02 by su_estupinan, git commit , build configuration: MPI VTK SQ SMALLBIG, models: HERTZ TANGENTIAL_HISTORY TANGENTIAL_NO_HISTORY COHESION_SJKR COHESION_SJKR2 ROLLING_EPSD2 SURFACE_DEFAULT SURFACE_SUPERQUADRIC)
# sq_pour_125_cubes.in: SUPERQUADRIC reference for the multi-particle surrogate test (Spec 06)
# Matches ../surrogate_multi/in.pour_125_cubes: same box, 6 walls, lattice, random shift,
# random orientations (same seeds), material, dt, 30 000 steps. Used for PERFORMANCE comparison
# only (comparison report section 3.8), not for comparing results.
#
# Cube = superquadric, half-axes L/2, blockiness 1000 (as in the single-particle comparison).
# Difference to the surrogate run (important when reading timings): here cube-cube contact is a
# REAL superquadric shape contact (pair_style ... surface superquadric), while the surrogate run
# uses a sphere placeholder (Spec 04 R04.7). Wall contact is comparable 1:1.
# Requires a build with -DENABLE_SQ=ON -DENABLE_MODEL_SURFACE_SUPERQUADRIC=ON (see README.md).
#
# Run:  [mpirun -np N]  liggghts -in sq_pour_125_cubes.in

units           si
atom_style      superquadric
atom_modify     map array
dimension       3
boundary        f f f
newton          off
communicate     single vel yes

variable        L equal 0.01
region          domain block -0.06 0.06 -0.06 0.06 0.0 0.20 units box
create_box      1 domain
Created orthogonal box = (-0.06 -0.06 0) to (0.06 0.06 0.2)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid

# 5 x 5 x 5 = 125 cubes on a lattice, spacing 2.0 L, plus a random shift of <= 0.1 L, so the
# bounding spheres (diameter 1.73 L) never overlap at start. Lattice points (origin 0) at
# x,y = -0.040 ... +0.040 m, side walls at +-0.06 m (clearance 1.1 L beyond the bounding radius)
# -- no particle may start inside a wall or another particle; z = 0.06 ... 0.14 m.
lattice         sc 0.020 origin 0 0 0
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 0.02 0.02 0.02
region          fill block -0.041 0.041 -0.041 0.041 0.055 0.145 units box
create_atoms    1 region fill
Created 125 atoms
displace_atoms  all random 0.0005 0.0005 0.0005 15013 units box

variable        h equal 0.5*${L}
variable        h equal 0.5*0.01
set             atom * shape ${h} ${h} ${h} blockiness 1000 1000 density 1000
set             atom * shape 0.005 ${h} ${h} blockiness 1000 1000 density 1000
set             atom * shape 0.005 0.005 ${h} blockiness 1000 1000 density 1000
set             atom * shape 0.005 0.005 0.005 blockiness 1000 1000 density 1000
  125 settings made for shape
  125 settings made for blockiness
  125 settings made for density
set             atom * quat/random 15017
  125 settings made for quat/random

fix             m1 all property/global youngsModulus peratomtype 1.0e7
fix             m2 all property/global poissonsRatio peratomtype 0.25
fix             m3 all property/global coefficientRestitution peratomtypepair 1 0.6
fix             m4 all property/global coefficientFriction peratomtypepair 1 0.4

fix             integrate all nve/superquadric integration_scheme 1
fix             gravity all gravity 9.81 vector 0.0 0.0 -1.0

fix             wz0 all wall/gran model hertz tangential history surface superquadric primitive type 1 zplane 0.0
